### AI Video Generator – Project overview and entry points

- **Backend (FastAPI)**: `uvicorn` app at [cat-video-creator/backend/app.py](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/app.py)
  - Logs config: [cat-video-creator/backend/logging_config.py](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/logging_config.py)
  - Local run: `uvicorn app:app --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8080 --reload`
  - Output root: `VIDEOHELPER_OUTPUT_DIR` → defaults to `cat-video-creator/output/`
- **Frontend (React + Vite + TS + Tailwind + shadcn/ui)**
  - Entry: [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/main.tsx](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/main.tsx), App: [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/App.tsx](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/App.tsx)
  - UI: [cat-video-creator/frontend/src/components/components/ui](mdc:cat-video-creator/frontend/src/components/components/ui)
  - Local run: `npm run dev` in `cat-video-creator/frontend`
  - Default API base: `http://localhost:8080` (can be overridden with `VITE_API_BASE` at build time)
- **Dev helper**: [start.sh](mdc:start.sh) launches both backend and frontend with logs into `logs/`
- **Docker**
  - Backend: [Dockerfile.backend](mdc:Dockerfile.backend)
  - Frontend: [Dockerfile.frontend](mdc:Dockerfile.frontend)
- **Requirements**
  - Backend minimal (tests/dev): [cat-video-creator/backend/requirements-dev.txt](mdc:cat-video-creator/backend/requirements-dev.txt)
  - Unified project (used by `start.sh`/Docker): [requirements.txt](mdc:requirements.txt)

### Environment and conventions
- **Auth**: If `API_KEY` is set, protected routes require `X-API-Key` header
- **CORS**: `CORS_ALLOW_ORIGINS` ("*" or comma-separated list)
- **Rate limiting**: `RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE` per-IP
- **MoneyPrinter deps**: `PEXELS_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_API_KEY` or `GEMINI_API_KEY`
- **TTS**: Kokoro with `espeak-ng`; macOS: `brew install espeak-ng`
- **WebSocket updates**: `/ws/jobs/{job_id}`

### Primary API endpoints
- GET `/api/health`, GET `/api/ping`
- POST `/api/moneyprinter/generate`
- POST `/api/brainrot/generate`
- GET `/api/jobs/{job_id}`, GET `/api/jobs`, POST `/api/jobs/{job_id}/cancel`
- GET `/api/models`, GET `/api/voices`, GET `/api/voice-sample`
- GET `/api/gpu-info`, GET `/api/metrics`, GET `/api/metrics/stats`
- Cache: GET `/api/cache/stats`, POST `/api/cache/clear`
- Batch: POST `/api/batch`, POST `/api/batch/{batch_id}/start`, GET `/api/batch/{batch_id}`, GET `/api/batch/{batch_id}/results`, POST `/api/batch/{batch_id}/cancel`, GET `/api/batches`, POST `/api/brainrot/playlist`
- Files: GET `/api/download`, GET `/api/list-videos`